{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/427425-pre-40s-valkyrie-predecessor","id":427425,"title":"Pre-40s VALKYRIE Predecessor","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-03T21:47:33-08:00","id":427425,"title":"Pre-40s VALKYRIE Predecessor","content":"So I'm tinkering with what would effectively be Conspiracy &quot;splat-books&quot;, including some historic forms of the Conspiracies through time, and I want some opinions on VALKYRIE...<br /> <br /> We know that VALKYRIE traces its own history back to the 1860s, but would not be reformed into &quot;Task Force VALKYRIE&quot; until WW2. This fits with the rise of the military industrial complex in the form we currently know. Before that, I was going to call the group (informally) the <b><i>Shadow Service</i></b>, operating from within the Secret Service (only true federal law enforcement agency before the FBI is created in 1908). So how best to handle them...<br /> <br /> 1) Pretty much just make the Shadow Service historic VALKYRIE, complete with less-advanced Advanced Armory (there will definitely be less advanced AA featured in the book regardless for WW2 VALKYRIE, but whether I go back further or not is in question).<br /> <br /> 2) The Shadow Service is a thematically different Conspiracy lacking the military-industrial resources that the WW2 reconstitution provides it as VALKYRIE - it has a completely different Endowment? If so, what?<br /> <br /> or<br /> <br /> 3) The Shadow Service lacking the formal organization and resources they get in WW2, is a Tier 2 organization. It may have a 1-5 Endowment related to accessing government intel and resources, and may even actively recruit Stigmatic Psychics, but it does not have anything with the oomph at their disposal of Tier 3 Endowments yet.<br /> <br /> <br /> Opinions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T00:58:10-08:00","id":427514,"title":"","content":"Hmmmm.<br /> <br /> Well obviously the Shadow Service (insert pun here) falls apart, so and that gives me ideas.<br /> <br /> The USA system of federal/states was inspired by Native American confederations and there's a lot of Freemason / illuminati rumours sounding the founding of the USA.<br /> <br /> So why not say their Endowment is basically the product of something like a Mummy effigy relic. The USA constitution and quite a bit of it's architecture is designed to funnel humans around in a way that creates occult energy; this energy has a resonance of Freedom and other things the Founding Father's liked. However it's slowly failing because, well, not just slavery and the treatment of the natives (bringing the Endowment in conflict with old Native contracts with the Spirits) whom a lot of the lore came from but more generally the USA is run by humans, humans who fail to live up to it's principles. I'm sure there's plenty of rail barrons, strike breaking and other examples that could feed into a general imperfect.<br /> <br /> <br /> This would make a nice contrast to the Lord Stewards who have a similar Endowment - and of course the history of early USA vs Britain. The Stewards Endowment grew organically, human imperfection is built into the system, sometimes they're contractually obligated to do bad things, but their system achieves it's more modest goals. The Shadow Service reached for the stars and failed, they're the guys we root for, but sadly it fails.<br /> <br /> <br /> BTW. How much of this book is written so far? Can I read the drafts please <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T01:05:08-08:00","id":427519,"title":"","content":"VALKYRIE is all about the reach of a government conspiracy and the fun toys you get with a national budget. I feel like a VALKYRIE predecessor should almost have kind of a Delta Green feel; clever men and women getting by with their wits, not with hypertech gadgets, and desperately trying to find a supernatural that their superiors don't believe in. Downgrade them to a Compact, try and make them feel more desperate, and make things feel far more espionage than war.<br /> <br /> That way, WW2's likely blatant supernatural horrors (Nazi sorcerers, Soviet reanimated casualties, etc) finally proved proto-VALKYRIE's purpose and gave them a black budget that gives them all their Advanced Armory goodies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T01:25:24-08:00","id":427523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/427425-pre-40s-valkyrie-predecessor?p=427514#post427514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmm.<br /> <br /> Well obviously the Shadow Service (insert pun here) falls apart, so and that gives me ideas.<br /> <br /> The USA system of federal/states was inspired by Native American confederations and there's a lot of Freemason / illuminati rumours sounding the founding of the USA.<br /> <br /> So why not say their Endowment is basically the product of something like a Mummy effigy relic. The USA constitution and quite a bit of it's architecture is designed to funnel humans around in a way that creates occult energy; this energy has a resonance of Freedom and other things the Founding Father's liked. However it's slowly failing because, well, not just slavery and the treatment of the natives (bringing the Endowment in conflict with old Native contracts with the Spirits) whom a lot of the lore came from but more generally the USA is run by humans, humans who fail to live up to it's principles. I'm sure there's plenty of rail barrons, strike breaking and other examples that could feed into a general imperfect.</div> </div> </div> </div>that idea kinda reminds me of another fan made conspiracy I once read called the Carpenters. Maybe I have a copy of it somewhere...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T03:39:58-08:00","id":427562,"title":"","content":"Well, as a task force, VALKYRIE presumably started as an inter-agency group; so what you probably had before TFV was established as a kind of twilight agency governing committee was a bunch of compacts scattered throughout the federal government and military with more specific encounters and focuses. <br /> <br /> I would suggest, given the state of the US government bureaucracy before 1941, that the following are reasonable:<br /> <br /> -Something out of the Office of Naval Intelligence. <br /> <br /> -The real reason the Black Chamber was &quot;disbanded.&quot; <br /> <br /> -The Marine Corps and it's various encounters during missions abroad. <br /> <br /> -The US Secret Service. <br /> <br /> -Some kind of unofficial high politics paranormal defense group; the predecessor to the Barrett Commission.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T10:13:39-08:00","id":427801,"title":"","content":"I remember the carpenters well. I thought about them half way through writing my previous post, so they may well have been a subconcious influence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T05:38:51-07:00","id":432557,"title":"","content":"In dogs of war, it offers the possibility that the US has a stockpile of magic items. <br /> <br /> Combine pressure from aegis and all the ways that magic items can curse or backfire on the user, it wouldn't be hard to see the US to decide just keeping those things instead of using them is the safer option. <br /> <br /> To give them a specific flavor, maybe they're items made from hermetic magic thanks to all the secret societies, or perhaps they're shamanic objects borrowed from the friendly native american shaman types.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T13:09:48-07:00","id":432999,"title":"","content":"I imagine the 1860s TF:V predecessor to be like the old Wild, Wild West TV series from the late 70s.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3738-illuminated-minutia","name":"Illuminated Minutia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3738_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T12:51:21-07:00","id":451953,"title":"","content":"I imagine the original group would have close ties with the Pinkerton Detective Agency, since they had close ties to the Lincoln administration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T21:22:43-07:00","id":457724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/427425-pre-40s-valkyrie-predecessor?p=451953#post451953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I imagine the original group would have close ties with the Pinkerton Detective Agency, since they had close ties to the Lincoln administration.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would have a bit of of bad blood with The Union in that case.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T02:50:45-07:00","id":459764,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't imagine it an issue, since the Union is only about a decade old, so the lincoln administration is ancient history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T12:48:07-07:00","id":460310,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/defaultd4c2.html?g=posts&amp;t=36947\" target=\"_blank\">Did someone mention the Carpenters?</a><br /> <br /> I'll repost them, for the edification of the new ones among us.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}